# The build context is the repository root, but the image needs almost none of
# it: the server, its lockfile, and graph/graph.json. Everything else is either
# large, irrelevant, or regenerable.

.git
.github
.vscode
node_modules
**/node_modules

# The knowledge itself. The server reads the derived graph, never the markdown,
# so shipping 333 source files would only make the image bigger and staler.
wiki
research
sources
concepts
projections
scripts
infra

# Derived, but only graph.json is read at runtime.
graph/*.jsonl
graph/stats.json
graph/README.md

# Local-only tooling
mcp/hve-iq/smoke.js
mcp/hve-iq/README.md
mcp/hve-iq/Dockerfile

*.md
!mcp/hve-iq/package.json
